  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ふぅん」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「たしかに、そうかもね。うんうん。そういうとこあるよ、なっつんには」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「『みんな大好き』、ってとこがね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「喩えるなら、なっつんは誰が見ても良さがわかる、大衆娯楽なんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「絵に喩えて悪いけどね、他のことはよく知らないから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「たとえば少年誌の、漫画とかね。老若男女、誰が見てもそこそこ楽しめる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「通俗的で、一般的で、悪く言えば大衆に媚びてる絵だ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「みんなに好かれたいから、みんなが好きなものを描く。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「なっつんは、そんなふうに生きてる。そんなふうな絵が、なっつんの人生だ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でもね、それはそれで極めるのが難しい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「漫画だって、すべてが売れるわけじゃない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「みんなに『そこそこ』愛される絵を描くことは、誰かひとりの『いちばん』になることと同じぐらい、難しいんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「誰かひとりにいちばん愛されるってのは、芸術の絵だ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「世界にひとりだけしか良さがわからない、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「けれどその『ひとり』にとっては世界のどんな絵と比べてもいちばんの、絵だよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「それを追い求めるのが、芸術。異性愛も、そうだよね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「世界でたったひとり、自分をいちばん愛してくれるひとを、求めて、得る。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「おおくの芸術家が、それを究めようとする。でも、それもとっても難しい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「たとえばゴッホは、生前はほとんど評価されなかった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「誰からも愛されずに、けれど己を信じて、描きつづけた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「今では、彼の業績と才能を認めないものはいないよね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「たとえばピカソは、写実的な、誰にでもすごさがわかる絵もとても上手だった。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「けれど後世はゲルニカなど、キュビズムに傾倒して、さっぱりわからん絵を描いてた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でもそれを、世界一の絵だと評価してるひともいる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でもたぶんピカソは生涯、誰にも理解されていない、って思ってたんじゃないかな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あたしの、想像だけどね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「だけど、ピカソは誰に何と言おうとも、彼自身が追い求める絵を描きつづけた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「ピカソ自身だけがたぶんきっと、自分の絵を、ちゃんと理解してた」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「どの絵が、どんな生きかたが正解かなんてわからない。正解なんて、ない。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「でも、そこには人生をかけるだけの価値がある」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「芸術か、大衆娯楽か。どちらも、茨の道さ。極められるのは、ほんのいちぶ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「たぶん、なっつんにちょっと耳に痛いことを言ったその子はね、焦れったかったんじゃないかな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「なっつんは、誰かひとりにいちばん愛される芸術的な絵も描けるはずなのに、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「大衆娯楽ばかり描いているから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「なっつんは自分で芸術か大衆娯楽か選ばずに、流されるままに、『みんなが好き』な絵を描いてる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「それが、見てられなかったんだよ、きっと」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「なっつんの本気が、芸術的な絵が、見たかったんだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「たぶん、その子は自分では描けないから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「自分とよく似ていて、でも芸術的な『いちばん』の絵も描けるはずの、なっつんに描いてほしかったんだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "もも",
    "text": "「あたしは、そう思うな。って、伝わってるかな？　ごみんに、喋るの苦手なんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 23,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -2,
      "y": 412
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「いや。何となく、わかったよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「そうだね。わたしは、居心地のいい『みんな大好き』のなかに閉じこもって、一生懸命にならなかった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「誰かを夢中で好きになったことも、たったひとつの愛を得るために、命をかけることもなかった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「手を抜いてた、わけじゃないんだよ。でも、流されてた。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sleepy",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 520
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "「それが、ゆうちゃんにはきっと、見てられなかったんだ」"
  },
  {
